-- Covering indexes for unindexed foreign keys (#1483).
-- 124 FK columns had no covering index, forcing sequential scans on the child
-- table to enforce referential integrity on parent UPDATE/DELETE and to satisfy
-- JOINs on the FK column. Each index below is purely additive — no query changes.
--
-- Plain CREATE INDEX (not CONCURRENTLY): `supabase db push` runs a migration's
-- statements in a single pipeline, where CONCURRENTLY errors with SQLSTATE 25001.
-- The brief ACCESS SHARE build lock is negligible on these small tables.
-- supabase advisor: unindexed_foreign_keys. Columns sourced from live
-- pg_constraint FK definitions (the advisor's column numbers were stale).

